              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 3:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kicorak Daudi ikatumunakake, koarata kes, kotubonosi akaninikec, ka akejenekec, kikajakis kes eiduny katapar koKeburon. Konye koyaŋaasi akou naka Is-boset, kidaikis ates naka Abiner Keburon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
